		Paragraph: A bulleted list whose items start with `[ ]` or `[x]` and a space is a list of tasks: a `List` with `Marker: checkbox`, checked in the items written with `[x]`. It needs no `Bullet markers`. All the items of the list are tasks or none is, and `\[ ]` is text.
